{
  "$comment": "Pinned JSON shape emitted by draftContract() in gen.py (intake-page-v5). Filed by Naya Zeta w447, gr-w444 gapclose. Spec-first: enforced at regen time by gate_regen_contract.js (emitter shape vs this spec, exit 0/2, fail-closed) and at consumption time by validate_contract.js (live blob vs this spec, exit 0/2). Proven w456: gate GATE-PASS on w453 regen bytes (199931B, head d90abe63d5ba), both mutation probes exit 2 with named reasons.",
